{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isle of Lament is a haunting, atmospheric adventure where nature and the supernatural entwine. Explore mist-covered forests, desolate graveyards, and crumbling lighthouses in a semi-open world steeped in Balkan and Eastern European folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/99d4b0e100c54e77dbd74d20f50cf404.poster.avif?t=1762094450\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/99d4b0e100c54e77dbd74d20f50cf404.webm?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/99d4b0e100c54e77dbd74d20f50cf404.mp4?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Awaken Your Dark Gift</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are bound to the island by a mysterious curse \u2014 but it also grants you power.<br>Use your <strong>supernatural senses</strong> to track and banish restless spirits. Gather <strong>Insight Points</strong> by uncovering the island\u2019s secrets, then unlock dark abilities such as <strong>Shadow Cloak</strong>, <strong>Dark Sight</strong>, and <strong>Spectral Passage</strong> to traverse forbidden places and face what lies beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel the Island\u2019s Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> woven into the world itself \u2014 from ancient shrines to waterlogged crypts. Observe your surroundings, follow hidden clues, and uncover the truth buried beneath centuries of myth and sorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/7c692237ab0dc271041b453efe5b37b8.poster.avif?t=1762094450\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/7c692237ab0dc271041b453efe5b37b8.webm?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/7c692237ab0dc271041b453efe5b37b8.mp4?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folklore Reimagined</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <strong>Balkan and Eastern European myths</strong>, <i>Isle of Lament</i> breathes life into forgotten superstitions and ghostly tales. Every story, symbol, and spirit you encounter draws from real regional folklore \u2014 creating a world that feels both familiar and otherworldly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/a84dffc347ace34ce81c21fd1abe1b25.poster.avif?t=1762094450\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/a84dffc347ace34ce81c21fd1abe1b25.webm?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/a84dffc347ace34ce81c21fd1abe1b25.mp4?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546140?t=1762094450","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546140?t=1762094450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/d5c6e8f619c3238dea5c6c8c017db842e2dd746b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762094450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/d5c6e8f619c3238dea5c6c8c017db842e2dd746b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762094450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains depictions of blood and non-realistic corpses."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isle of Lament is a haunting, atmospheric adventure where nature and the supernatural entwine. Explore mist-covered forests, desolate graveyards, and crumbling lighthouses in a semi-open world steeped in Balkan and Eastern European folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/99d4b0e100c54e77dbd74d20f50cf404.poster.avif?t=1762094450\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/99d4b0e100c54e77dbd74d20f50cf404.webm?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/99d4b0e100c54e77dbd74d20f50cf404.mp4?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Awaken Your Dark Gift</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are bound to the island by a mysterious curse \u2014 but it also grants you power.<br>Use your <strong>supernatural senses</strong> to track and banish restless spirits. Gather <strong>Insight Points</strong> by uncovering the island\u2019s secrets, then unlock dark abilities such as <strong>Shadow Cloak</strong>, <strong>Dark Sight</strong>, and <strong>Spectral Passage</strong> to traverse forbidden places and face what lies beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel the Island\u2019s Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> woven into the world itself \u2014 from ancient shrines to waterlogged crypts. Observe your surroundings, follow hidden clues, and uncover the truth buried beneath centuries of myth and sorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/7c692237ab0dc271041b453efe5b37b8.poster.avif?t=1762094450\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/7c692237ab0dc271041b453efe5b37b8.webm?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/7c692237ab0dc271041b453efe5b37b8.mp4?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folklore Reimagined</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <strong>Balkan and Eastern European myths</strong>, <i>Isle of Lament</i> breathes life into forgotten superstitions and ghostly tales. Every story, symbol, and spirit you encounter draws from real regional folklore \u2014 creating a world that feels both familiar and otherworldly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/a84dffc347ace34ce81c21fd1abe1b25.poster.avif?t=1762094450\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/a84dffc347ace34ce81c21fd1abe1b25.webm?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/extras/a84dffc347ace34ce81c21fd1abe1b25.mp4?t=1762094450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nostos Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546140/fd37fda5ba57b4c749ea04482aede152637e6166/header.jpg?t=1762094450","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Isle of Lament","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 @ 2.80GHz or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 580 / NV GTX 1070 / 6 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K @ 3.60GHz or AMD Ryzen 7 2700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD 5700 / NVIDIA RTX 2080 / Intel ARC / 8 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Nostos Interactive"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat